  "details": "A friends of mine and I have recently been having issues with receiving invites. It's hard to pin down an exact time frame for when this began, but it's been semi-recent (past 2 weeks or so). \nThe individual who is not able to receive/see invites *can*, however, send them to other people, and those other people can see the invite request.\nRestarting the application seems to be the thing that fixes this issue. \nIt doesn't seem to occur when you first boot into the application, but something goes wrong if you've been on for an hour or two.",
